 accuracy to make this dependence useful
 and we consider }{\f1 q}{, along with }{\f1 
s}{ and }{\f1 t}{\fs16 \dn6 o}{, as }{\b0 
unknown parameters}{. }{We therefore write
 the radar data in the form}}
}
