{\plain {To complete a practical model for
 the received data, we add a sample function
 of a white normal random sequence that 
models the }{\b0 thermal noise}{\b0  that
 is always present in radar data due to 
the material composition of the rec}{eiver
 and the viewed scene- the sky, for example.
 So t}{he }{\b range-finding radar data 
model}{ is thus given by (31.2):}}
}
