 the data and study the resolution properties.}{
 \par A sample spacing adequate for processing
 may be to large for good accuracy. What
 can be done? (Hint: recall Sec.16!) \par 
Since the matched filter has a FR with a
 quadratic phase, it has a delay that depends
 linearly upon frequency. Give a simple,
 even graphical, explanation for the compression
 phenomenon.}}
